From f3cd0e1ef737dbf7383961d66fc2d4f3e011766b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karthikeyan K <karthikk@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 29 Mar 2022 06:13:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-66675] rom: tpm: add tpm init routine

Adding tpm initialization routine in rom . This initializes the
locality in use and preliminary checks like revision id and device
id reads from spi slave.

Change-Id: I0a4fb724d821d52e7287ed68740b291534392924
---

